      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "questName": "DNS Recon",
      "questDescription": "Brandon asks you to investigate NovaSolutions' DNS records while his team examines unexplained traffic spikes. First complete a network-path exercise, then compare authoritative and recursive DNS replies and identify a /24 that contains two observed addresses. These observations do not establish the cause of the spikes or ownership of the full range.",
      "questCompleteText": "<b>Brandon:</b> You completed the path exercise, distinguished an authoritative DNS reply, and grouped two observed addresses within the same /24. We still need traffic logs and asset records to connect those clues to the spikes.",
